ue Date</strong></td><td>{{ $json.due_date || 'NOT FOUND' }}</td></tr><tr><td><strong>PO Number</strong></td><td>{{ $json.purchase_order_number || 'N/A' }}</td></tr></table><table><tr><th>Amount</th><th style='text-align:right'>Value</th></tr><tr><td>Subtotal</td><td style='text-align:right'>{{ $json.currency }} {{ $json.subtotal }}</td></tr><tr><td>Tax</td><td style='text-align:right'>{{ $json.currency }} {{ $json.tax_amount }}</td></tr><tr style='background:#fffbeb'><td><strong>TOTAL</strong></td><td style='text-align:right' class='amount'><strong>{{ $json.currency }} {{ $json.total_amount }}</strong></td></tr></table><p style='text-align:center'><a href='https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1hUQk37b6gmmWlKd-9DHbMr3knssAke939MZ8MWr38aI' class='cta-btn'>📊 Review in Google Sheets</a></p><div class='footer'><p>⏰ Processed: {{ $json.processing_timestamp }}</p><p>This invoice has been saved to the Pending Review sheet and awaits your action.</p></div></div></body></html>",
