/ 8) }} workdays)</p></div><div class='stats-grid'><div class='stat-card'><div class='stat-value'>{{ $json.total_processed }}</div><div class='stat-label'>Total Invoices Processed</div></div><div class='stat-card'><div class='stat-value'>{{ $json.auto_approval_rate }}%</div><div class='stat-label'>Auto-Approval Rate</div></div><div class='stat-card'><div class='stat-value'>{{ $json.auto_approved }}</div><div class='stat-label'>Auto-Approved ✅</div></div><div class='stat-card'><div class='stat-value'>{{ $json.pending_review }}</div><div class='stat-label'>Flagged for Review ⚠️</div></div></div><p class='section-title'>📋 Financial Summary</p><table><tr><th>Metric</th><th>Value</th></tr><tr><td>Total Invoice Volume</td><td><strong>${{ $json.total_invoice_amount }}</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Average AI Confidence Score</td><td><strong>{{ $json.avg_confidence_score }}%</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Top Vendors This Week</td><td>{{ $json.top_vendors }}</td></tr></table><div class='footer'><p>🤖 Powered by n8n Intelligent Invoice Processing System</p><p>Questions? Contact your IT administrator</p></div></div></body></html>",
        "options": {}
      },
